    "body": "There were several issues in the Traditional Chinese translation where Mainland Chinese vocabulary was used instead of the more local Taiwanese style Mandarin language.\r\n\r\n- \"質量\" -> \"品質\" (quality)\r\n- \"連接\" -> \"連線\" (connection)\r\n- \"窗口\" -> \"視窗\" (window)\r\n- \"登錄\" -> \"登入\" (login)\r\n- \"鏈接\" -> \"連結\" (link)\r\n- \"保存\" -> \"儲存\" (save)\r\n- \"重命名\" -> \"重新命名\" (rename)\r\n- \"撤銷\" -> \"還原\" (undo)\r\n- \"打開\" -> \"開啟\" (open)\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/qTox/658)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
