                "message": "docs(i18n): Correct Lojban grammar and improve UI string verbosity.\n\n- Remove double descriptor `lo loi`, replacing it with `loi`.\n- Replace possessive `do loi` with `do`.\n- Strip the `nu` (event abstraction) from action verbs for standard UI\n  buttons (e.g., Cancel, Save, Remove) so they read as actions rather\n  than abstractions, saving space and improving the native UI feel.",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "9dcff8400fe5bcf8ebba3e71b22a4fd40be08346",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/trees/9dcff8400fe5bcf8ebba3e71b22a4fd40be08346"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/commits/637fe0db9c466b0db01a04379d925dd124a6fd5d",
                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree 9dcff8400fe5bcf8ebba3e71b22a4fd40be08346\nparent 0d9663722b79760367cb2197a1ea2c526f35246e\nauthor iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1771285292 +0000\ncommitter iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1771585164 +0000\n\ndocs(i18n): Correct Lojban grammar and improve UI string verbosity.\n\n- Remove double descriptor `lo loi`, replacing it with `loi`.\n- Replace possessive `do loi` with `do`.\n- Strip the `nu` (event abstraction) from action verbs for standard UI\n  buttons (e.g., Cancel, Save, Remove) so they read as actions rather\n  than abstractions, saving space and improving the native UI feel.\n",
