                "message": "docs(i18n): Improve Traditional Chinese (zh-TW) localization phrasing\n\nThere were several issues in the Traditional Chinese translation where\nMainland Chinese vocabulary was used instead of the more local Taiwanese\nstyle Mandarin language.\n\n- \"質量\" -> \"品質\" (quality)\n- \"連接\" -> \"連線\" (connection)\n- \"窗口\" -> \"視窗\" (window)\n- \"登錄\" -> \"登入\" (login)\n- \"鏈接\" -> \"連結\" (link)\n- \"保存\" -> \"儲存\" (save)\n- \"重命名\" -> \"重新命名\" (rename)\n- \"撤銷\" -> \"還原\" (undo)\n- \"打開\" -> \"開啟\" (open)",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "31a25860600e5f0ce76aba185bfbb361aef116c9",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/trees/31a25860600e5f0ce76aba185bfbb361aef116c9"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/commits/c9e96af9c7b1491b234ea6c3de0518ec400f9f85",
                "verification": {
